  "headline": "FDA's records trace our aprepitant supply to a plant classified OAI 239 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E9", "D4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1292960 of Pharmathen International S.A. (FEI 3009961173) ended on 2025-11-21 and was classified OAI, with the classification known to FDA on 2026-02-26.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The OAI classification occurred 239 days before the shortage posting date of 2026-07-17.",
      "cites": ["E9", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA issued a Warning Letter to Pharmathen International S.A. on 2026-05-27.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA published Import Alert 66-40 for Pharmathen International S.A. on 2026-04-23.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows Merck Sharp & Dohme LLC's aprepitant oral powder for suspension (NDC 0006-3066-03) was posted as 'To Be Discontinued' on 2026-04-08 with discontinuation expected in early-September 2026.",
      "cites": ["E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list also shows Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC's fosaprepitant dimeglumine injection (NDC 63323-972-10) was posted as 'To Be Discontinued' on 2026-04-08.",
      "cites": ["E13"]
    }
  ]
}
